  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting more inclusive and accountable democratic institutions in Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen democratic institutions and governance in Tanzania by working with Parliament, political parties, civil society and the media to improve capacity and strengthen accountability mechanisms, promote institutions and political processes that are more inclusive and foster economic growth that provides more benefits for poor people.</narrative>
  </description>
